Apple will announce its rumored low-cost MacBook at its <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/2026/02/16/apple-announces-special-event-in-new-york/">event on March 4</a>, with the device coming in a selection of bold color options, according to a known leaker.<br/>
<br/>
